<metadata><name>Galičica trail MTB-1</name><desc>MTB-1 is one of Galičica National Park's mountain bike trails, several of which link the hiking routes. It runs 2.5 km from Ramne to the Ohrid visitor centre, climbing about 0 m and descending 193 m in the direction drawn, between 770 m and 965 m. https://galicica.finereli.com/trails/mtb-1/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
<wpt lat="41.109305" lon="20.836922"><name>MTB-1 start</name><desc>Ramne</desc><sym>Trail Head</sym></wpt>
